{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "de817972745f14b24c99ccb6db244abd8e32831bc1fa8e967f3b4f8cd234695c", "ja": "まっすぐな心", "zh": "率直的心", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e65d7445fd80cf1b5fa1a1c5cb439a207d5e792cea0d832d93c05524103df87", "ja": "冒険艦『馬場』を強襲するマツリ。ピンチの\nヒナタを救ったのは、チハヤの機転だった。\nその勇気ある行動に心動かされたヒナタは、\nチハヤと共に監獄星へ向かう決意を固める。\n今も眠り続けるクイーンのためにも、と。", "zh": "袭击冒险舰『马场』的茉莉。救下陷入危机的日向的，正是千早的机智应变。\n日向被这勇敢的行动打动，坚定了与千早一同前往监狱星的决心。\n这一切，也是为了至今仍沉睡不醒的女王。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1000_null", "source_sha256": "19b57f5f6aff2cad301dd52a33dc3c5eb0071155d2adebcc68a2fcdbcdc580a0", "ja": "アステロイドベルトの宇宙港で補給を受けていた\n冒険艦『馬場』を、マツリが強襲！", "zh": "正在小行星带的宇宙港接受补给的冒险舰『馬場』，遭到了茉莉的突袭！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1001_null", "source_sha256": "9f8512cf22280fdc43e14af9d51f6f845c072d5e7f673be65784aa713194723f", "ja": "『翠の悪魔』の圧倒的な戦闘能力に、\n追い詰められるヒナタ……その時、チハヤが駆けた！", "zh": "面对『翠绿恶魔』压倒性的战斗能力，  \n日向被逼入绝境……就在这时，千早冲了出去！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "175add360e6ee99a422c3710c6fa0d00531b4b3c556cd5d7256df63f27e279ab", "ja": "これは……施設がひとりでに崩壊していく……？\n貴様、いったい何をした？", "zh": "这……是设施在自行崩塌……？\n你这家伙，到底做了什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1003_se", "source_sha256": "463f7e5e27196e302ed2fa394835456ec34b4698cee027b7384c484ed701ac00", "ja": "ズドーンッ！　ゴゴゴゴ……ドォーン！", "zh": "轰——！轰隆隆……咚——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1004_002chi", "source_sha256": "1438408fec62c9ce59712ce49a06a2b357e127b269fb5a8e1499e3ec11f489e2", "ja": "ふっ、私は何も？　ただ機械音痴なだけです！\nで、でも、思ったより大変なことに……きゃあっ！？", "zh": "哼，我什么都没做？只是对机械一窍不通而已！\n但、但是，事情好像比想象中更严重……呀啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "6c4ddd664544ea31ccd5d54b4fa15eb2b121ff269932000d52a1d2337584ff40", "ja": "っと、危ない！　まったく、なんて無茶を……。\nほら、こっちだよ！　今のうちだ！", "zh": "等等，小心！真是的，怎么能这么乱来……\n喂，这边！趁现在！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "5b5344ec6598de7ca04b8b5a618a3689136ce02c3d2e70ea1ff61409ce938209", "ja": "逃がしたか……まあいい。じきに革命軍は起つ。\nこの決着は戦場でつけよう、ヒナタ。", "zh": "让她逃掉了吗……算了。革命军很快就会起事。这笔账，就在战场上算吧，日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1007_035hin", "source_sha256": "190e35f4609de3972e23faa5c4205fe0a3d2eedf1233a795238f172126fdec45", "ja": "どうして逃げなかったんだい？　チハヤ……\nあんた、やるべきことがあるって言ってたのに。", "zh": "为什么不逃走呢？千早……\n你不是说过还有该做的事吗。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "746970fa1a8845b50bc019f19b9d1cf6273c5c41a21a2c6e375ecdcbaa2959a2", "ja": "ええ。でも、誰かを犠牲にしては意味がありません。\nあなたのことも守りたいんです。", "zh": "是的。但是，如果要牺牲谁，就没有意义了。\n我也想保护你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "031eb4bada530467553eb0866296d0eb32cc8d573a0a78803ecfef7f1fae75f1", "ja": "弱っちいあんたが、あたしを守るだって？\nふふっ……バカバカしいねぇ。", "zh": "就凭软弱的你，也想保护我？\n呵呵……真是荒唐呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "93b185bfcdd4b4263f770647556fbd91f9e8108d30376e0c899b46e53e912e70", "ja": "けど……まっすぐなんだなぁ、あんた。", "zh": "可是……你还真是坦率啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1011_null", "source_sha256": "416e68b66f90e5c78c1f80024c4f528368560b1ab1a871910dd79a4af7f78b35", "ja": "ピンチは脱したものの、クルーを危険に晒すわけには\nいかないと、コノミは手を引く選択をする……", "zh": "虽然已经脱离危机，但不能让船员们陷入险境，木实选择了退出……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1012_null", "source_sha256": "edcb915104ea8220395d47c9a1d07dfc7a01a53b04f5aa6f5994941a4e5f89cf", "ja": "たったひとりで監獄星へ向かう意思を固めるチハヤに、\nヒナタは自分が、エミリーの侍女だったことを明かす。", "zh": "面对下定决心独自前往监狱星的千早，日向坦白了自己曾是艾米莉的侍女。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "8585c4da548565227b755ff742c9aa19380f86aa9e797cc6588eff04bf198204", "ja": "これは、生命維持カプセル……？　はっ！？\nクイーン・エミリー！？　生きていたのですね……！", "zh": "这是生命维持舱……？　什么！？\n艾米莉女王！？　您还活着……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1014_035hin", "source_sha256": "79ad15db2d20b5c92360ac113caf4b37cba11159ff4ce96896fcc4378eea12c3", "ja": "追手の目を逃れるため、かくまってもらってたんだ。\n姫さまを守ることが、あたしの役目だと思ってたから。", "zh": "为了躲开追兵的视线，我被人藏了起来。\n因为我觉得保护公主就是我的职责。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "9822765fa7b221cb8ba008cf875a3caa173cdd525aab0825dbc412c33dcee6a3", "ja": "でも違う。あたしがすべきは姫さまの願いを……宇宙の\n平和を叶えることだ。……あんたと行くよ、チハヤ。", "zh": "可是，不对。我该做的是实现公主殿下的愿望……让宇宙恢复和平。……我跟你一起走，千早。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0280_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0280_story_04_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "d850dea04d4578b962fc8a7fed165eecf36c45e3558a9b84274497de832ac9fc", "ja": "ヒナタ……。", "zh": "日向……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
